        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/turok-origins-big-lizard-with-gun.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>It is no secret to those paying attention to the video game industry that Saber Interactive's fortunes have change dramatically in recent years. First surging into prominence with the release of World War Z, it has been thrust into the limelight with  big hit <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/warhammer-40000-space-marine-2\">Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2</a>. Using that momentum, it has brought forward new entries in long-dead gaming series like <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/turok\">Turok</a> and Stuntman, and remakes of hallowed old games such as <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/star-wars-knights-of-the-old-republic\">Star Wars: Knights of the Old Republic</a></p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/saber-interactive-we-can-get-any-ip-gamescom-interview-1\">Read more</a></p>",
